{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>day.txt 是一款為 Mac、iPhone 與 iPad 而設的每日文字畫布，讓每天擁有獨立頁面，集中記錄計劃、想法、會議筆記與清單。它適合希望避開複雜排版與資料夾結構、專注書寫的使用者。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-152.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>每日一頁文字畫布</h2>\n<p>開啟 day.txt 即可直接書寫，無須建立版面或整理資料夾。每日一頁可記錄計劃、想法、會議筆記與清單，並以箭頭或日曆切換日期，日曆標記顯示哪些日子已有筆記。筆記保存在本機，透過私人 iCloud 在 Mac、iPhone 與 iPad 同步，離線仍可搜尋及閱讀本機記錄，連線後再同步，不經 day.txt 伺服器，亦無廣告或第三方分析。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-466-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-467-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-468-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-469-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-470-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-471-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：day.txt</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/day-txt/id6805007155?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T18:45:35.630328+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T18:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:42:46.113090+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T18:39:05.526921+00:00","content_hash":"d0f95b18bb11225230bb088402165c706a70b9bc5f9a0942395a9efce7a5d299","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}